{
  "key": "letter-161-part-01",
  "number": 161,
  "generationId": "01a1e8e2-6eb3-7822-b66c-3c1a725758da",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1970-161/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.656893
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Life is a mystery.",
      "path": "audio/1970-161/02.mp3",
      "start": 1.775556,
      "end": 2.906893
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "It can be lived.",
      "path": "audio/1970-161/03.mp3",
      "start": 4.122381,
      "end": 5.145215
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "It can also be known by living it.",
      "path": "audio/1970-161/04.mp3",
      "start": 6.333855,
      "end": 7.816281
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "But it cannot be solved like a mathematical problem.",
      "path": "audio/1970-161/05.mp3",
      "start": 9.03381,
      "end": 11.429841
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "It is not a problem - it is a challenge.",
      "path": "audio/1970-161/06.mp3",
      "start": 12.652766000000002,
      "end": 14.815805
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "It is not a question - it is an adventure.",
      "path": "audio/1970-161/07.mp3",
      "start": 15.977867999999999,
      "end": 18.269660000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Hence, those who only go on asking questions about life remain, by this action, deprived of the answer forever.",
      "path": "audio/1970-161/08.mp3",
      "start": 19.42195,
      "end": 26.170952
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Or acquire answers which are not answers at all.",
      "path": "audio/1970-161/09.mp3",
      "start": 27.772607999999998,
      "end": 30.512313000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "It is such answers that one acquires from scriptures.",
      "path": "audio/1970-161/10.mp3",
      "start": 32.105193,
      "end": 35.34
    }
  ]
}
